<h1>Help</h1>
<div class="bk-help-content">
    <h2>Navigating the Manual</h2>
    <p>Use the sidebar on the left to browse chapters and pages. Each page includes Previous/Next navigation at the bottom for sequential reading.</p>
    <h2>Document Properties</h2>
    <p>Each page has metadata properties including <strong>Author</strong>, <strong>Category</strong>, <strong>Chapter</strong>, and <strong>Order</strong>. Use the Properties page to browse by these attributes.</p>
    <h2>Conventions</h2>
    <p>See the <a href="rules.html">Conventions</a> page for documentation rules used in this manual.</p>
    <h2>Keyboard Shortcuts</h2>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>p</strong> - Previous page</li>
        <li><strong>n</strong> - Next page</li>
        <li><strong>h</strong> - Home (index)</li>
    </ul>
</div>
